  5.782404  0.000000  0.000000
  2.891202  3.840913  0.000000
  0.000000  0.000000  28.346456
ATOMIC_POSITIONS {crystal}
  C  -0.000722  0.001444  0.000000
  C  0.334055  0.331889  0.000000
K_POINTS {automatic}
